      "note": "PSY_AR_SIZE_SMALL_016 measures RELATIVE page coverage (a fraction DOAR can compute today); EN_COMPILED_VERY_SMALL_DRAWING_026 as literally written concerns ABSOLUTE figure size, which requires physical-scale calibration DOAR does not have (observability_class=not_operational). Conflating the two would silently promote an unmeasurable absolute-size claim under cover of the measurable relative-coverage rule."
